      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's easy to say that, but worth doesn't pay the landlord. it doesn't stop the collections calls. it's not just \"feeling down,\" it's the literal reality of my life. there's no math where this ends with me being okay. i'm just doing all this work to pay for the right to keep working. it's a loop that just eats itself. how are you supposed to find \"meaning\" in a system that's designed to keep you underwater?",
