      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know help is \"available,\" but help doesn't change the interest rates or the cost of living. it's just a way to keep people moving through the loop. it feels like the only difference between someone who succeeds and someone who fails is how much they can endure before they break. i'm already broken. when the numbers are this far gone, isn't it just a matter of time? it feels like the only real way to stop the math from being wrong is to just... stop participating.",
